-- Migration: Bloom's L3 rebalancing — REG batch 3 (60 questions)
-- Date: 2026-02-22
-- Purpose: Rewrite 60 L2 (Application) questions to L3 (Analysis) depth for REG section
-- Affected topics: Basis, Individual Income, Circular 230, Partnerships, Gains/Losses, Filing/Credits, C Corps, Credits, Contracts, Tax-Exempt Orgs, S Corps, Legal Duties, Deductions, Like-Kind Exchanges, Professional Ethics, Estate/Gift, Debtor-Creditor, Agency, Business Structures, Credits/AMT, Tax Procedures, Govt Regulation, AMT, Federal Tax Procedures

BEGIN;

